### Auto Escola 3ESR - colecao de requisicoes (REST Client do VS Code / HTTP Client do IntelliJ)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### 1. Login (admin/admin, criado pela migration V10). Copie o campo "tokenJWT" da resposta para @token.
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "admin",
  "senha": "admin"
}

###
@token = COLE_AQUI_O_TOKEN_JWT

### Health check (publico)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health-check

### ===================== INSTRUTORES =====================

### Cadastrar instrutor (ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/instrutores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Carlos Instrutor",
  "email": "carlos@autoescola.com",
  "telefone": "11988887777",
  "cnh": "01234567890",
  "especialidade": "CARROS",
  "endereco": {
    "logradouro": "Rua das Flores",
    "numero": "100",
    "complemento": "Sala 1",
    "bairro": "Centro",
    "cidade": "São Paulo",
    "uf": "SP",
    "cep": "01001-000"
  }
}

### Listar instrutores ativos (ADMIN, USER)
GET {{baseUrl}}/instrutores?page=0&size=10&sort=nome
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalhar instrutor (ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/instrutores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar instrutor (ADMIN)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/instrutores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "telefone": "11977776666",
  "especialidade": "MOTOS"
}

### Excluir instrutor - exclusao logica (ADMIN)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/instrutores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===================== ALUNOS =====================

### Cadastrar aluno (ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/alunos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Ana Silva",
  "email": "ana@email.com",
  "telefone": "11999999999",
  "cpf": "12345678901",
  "endereco": {
    "logradouro": "Rua A",
    "numero": "10",
    "bairro": "Centro",
    "cidade": "São Paulo",
    "uf": "SP",
    "cep": "01234-567"
  }
}

### Listar alunos ativos (ADMIN, USER)
GET {{baseUrl}}/alunos?page=0&size=10&sort=nome
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalhar aluno (ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/alunos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar aluno - cpf nao pode ser alterado (ADMIN)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/alunos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "nome": "Ana Silva Souza",
  "telefone": "11911112222"
}

### Excluir aluno - exclusao logica (ADMIN)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/alunos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===================== USUARIOS =====================

### Cadastrar usuario (ADMIN). Sem "perfil", assume USER.
POST {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "secretaria",
  "senha": "senha123",
  "perfil": "USER"
}

### Listar usuarios (ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios?page=0&size=10&sort=login
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalhar usuario (ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar senha e/ou perfil (ADMIN)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 2,
  "senha": "novaSenha123",
  "perfil": "ADMIN"
}

### Excluir usuario - exclusao fisica; nao pode excluir o proprio usuario logado (ADMIN)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/usuarios/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===================== INSTRUCOES =====================

### Agendar instrucao com instrutor definido (ADMIN, USER)
### data_hora: segunda a sabado, 06:00-20:00, hora inteira, >= 30 min de antecedencia
POST {{baseUrl}}/instrucoes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_aluno": 1,
  "id_instrutor": 1,
  "data_hora": "19/10/2026 - 10:00"
}

### Agendar instrucao sem instrutor: especialidade obrigatoria, instrutor escolhido aleatoriamente (RN-A8)
POST {{baseUrl}}/instrucoes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_aluno": 1,
  "especialidade": "CARROS",
  "data_hora": "20/10/2026 - 14:00"
}

### Listar instrucoes (todas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/instrucoes?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar apenas instrucoes nao canceladas
GET {{baseUrl}}/instrucoes?ativas=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalhar instrucao (status e motivo de cancelamento)
GET {{baseUrl}}/instrucoes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancelar instrucao (>= 24 h de antecedencia). motivo: ALUNO_DESISTIU | INSTRUTOR_CANCELOU | OUTROS
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/instrucoes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_instrucao": 1,
  "motivo": "ALUNO_DESISTIU"
}

### ===================== ENDERECOS (ViaCEP) =====================

### Consultar CEP (ADMIN, USER)
GET {{baseUrl}}/enderecos/01001-000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CEP com formato invalido -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/enderecos/123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CEP inexistente -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/enderecos/99999-999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
